{
  "id": "bethsaida-briefing",
  "text": "Your walk: Healing the Blind at Bethsaida. This is game guidance, not a scripture quotation. In Bethsaida, people bring a blind man to Jesus and beg Him to touch him. You walk as a disciple with Jesus and choose how to meet this man. Listen to the Gospel, then act as He did. Take him by the hand, lead him out of the village, and heal him carefully. Full healing takes two touches. Three stars reflect alignment with the Gospel: Touch for method, high compassion for tender care, and medium power for measured strength. Excellent needs all three and the second touch. Nobody loses. Every outcome continues.",
